## WHICH APP ARE YOU IN?

### `saas/` — SaaS Admin Portal
- **Who uses it:** You (the platform owner). Never a shop owner or customer.
- **What it does:** Manage tenants (shop owners), plans, billing, announcements, audit logs.
- **Stack:** Next.js App Router + ShadcnUI + Zustand + TailwindCSS
- **Auth:** SaaS admin JWT (`role: superadmin | support`). No tenant context.
- **API base:** `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL/api/saas/`
- **Key stores:** `store/saas-auth.store.ts`
- **Schema doc to read:** `01-saas-admin-schema.md`
- **Key routes:**
  ```
  /                    → Dashboard (KPIs)
  /tenants             → All tenants list
  /tenants/[id]        → Tenant detail + config editor
  /plans               → Plan management
  /announcements       → Platform announcements
  /admins              → SaaS team members
  /settings            → Platform settings
  /audit               → Audit logs
  ```
- **Never** import from `admin/`, `web/`, or `mobile/`. Shared UI only from `packages/ui/` if it exists.

---

### `admin/` — Shop Admin Dashboard
- **Who uses it:** Shop owners and their team (manager, support, viewer roles).
- **What it does:** Full store management — products, orders, customers, marketing, analytics, settings.
- **Stack:** Next.js App Router + ShadcnUI + Zustand + TailwindCSS
- **Auth:** Shop admin JWT (`role: shop_admin | vendor | manager | support | viewer`). Always has `tenant_id`.
- **API base:** `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL/api/shop/admin/` for admin routes, `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL/api/shop/` for shared
- **Tenant header:** Every API call must include `X-Tenant-ID: {tenantId}` from auth store
- **Key stores:**
  ```
  store/auth.store.ts      → user, role, tenantId, JWT
  store/ui.store.ts        → sidebar open/close, theme
  ```
- **Schema docs to read:**
  ```
  02-ecommerce-schema.md          → all data models
  03-admin-dashboard-features.md  → every sidebar section + workflow
  05-backend-api.md               → exact API endpoints to call
  ```
- **Key routes:**
  ```
  /dashboard                     → KPI overview
  /inventory/products            → product list
  /inventory/products/new        → add product (9-section form)
  /inventory/products/[id]       → edit product
  /inventory/categories          → category tree manager
  /inventory/logs                → inventory history
  /orders                        → order list
  /orders/[id]                   → order detail + fulfillment
  /customers                     → customer list
  /customers/[id]                → customer detail
  /queries                       → support tickets
  /marketing/banners             → banner + ads manager
  /marketing/coupons             → discount codes
  /marketing/featured            → curate featured/new arrivals
  /mails/templates               → email template editor
  /mails/broadcast               → send campaign
  /analytics/overview            → sales charts
  /analytics/products            → product performance
  /finance/sales                 → sales report
  /finance/invoices              → GST invoices
  /delivery/zones                → shipping zone config
  /telegram                      → bot setup + alert toggles
  /settings/general              → shop info
  /settings/branding             → logo, colors
  /settings/payments             → Razorpay keys
  /settings/team                 → invite team members
  ```
- **Layout:** Uses `DashboardSidebar.tsx` with role-based link sets. Sidebar collapses on mobile.
- **Guards:** Every route wrapped in `AuthGuard` with `role="shop_admin"`. If `onboarding_complete === false` → redirect to `/onboarding`.

