### `web/` — Ecommerce Storefront
- **Who uses it:** End customers (anonymous + logged-in).
- **What it does:** Browse products, search, cart, checkout, account management.
- **Stack:** Next.js App Router + HeroUI + Zustand + TailwindCSS
- **Auth:** Customer JWT (`role: customer`). Guest checkout allowed.
- **API base:** `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL/api/shop/`
- **Tenant header:** `X-Tenant-ID` resolved from env var (one deployment per tenant) or subdomain
- **Key stores:**
  ```
  store/auth.store.ts   → user, JWT, isAuthenticated
  store/cart.store.ts   → items, coupon, pricing
  store/ui.store.ts     → drawer open, search open, theme
  ```
- **Schema docs to read:**
  ```
  02-ecommerce-schema.md           → product, order, user models
  04-ecommerce-client-features.md  → all pages, features, analytics events
  05-backend-api.md                → API endpoints (shop section only)
  06-auth-onboarding-flows.md      → customer auth flows
  ```
- **Rendering strategy:**
  ```
  Home page         → ISR (revalidate: 60)
  Product detail    → SSR (for SEO + fresh stock)
  Category listing  → SSR
  Account pages     → CSR (client-only, behind auth)
  Checkout          → CSR
  ```
- **Key routes:**
  ```
  /                          → Home (hero, new arrivals, featured, banners…)
  /products                  → Full catalogue
  /products/[slug]           → Product detail
  /category/[slug]           → Category filtered listing
  /search                    → Search results
  /cart                      → Cart page
  /checkout                  → Multi-step checkout
  /checkout/success          → Order success
  /wishlist                  → Guest + auth wishlist
  /track                     → Public order tracking
  /account/orders            → My orders
  /account/orders/[id]       → Order detail
  /account/profile           → Edit profile
  /account/addresses         → Address book
  /login                     → Login page
  /register                  → Register page
  /forgot-password           → Forgot password
  /contact                   → Query submission form
  /blog/[slug]               → Blog post
  /faq /privacy /terms /refund → Static policy pages
  ```
- **Cart behavior:** Guest cart lives in Zustand (persisted to localStorage). On login, POST `/api/shop/cart/sync` to merge.
- **Analytics:** Fire `track_event()` (see `lib/analytics.ts`) on: page_view, product_view, add_to_cart, checkout_started, checkout_completed, search, banner_click, coupon_applied.

