## SHARED RULES ACROSS ALL FRONTEND APPS

### API Calls
- Always use the wrapper in `lib/api.ts` — never raw `fetch`
- Always include `X-Tenant-ID` header (from auth store or env)
- Handle 401 → trigger silent refresh via interceptor
- Handle errors with toast (use app's toast library)

### TypeScript
- All API responses must be typed using models from `types/` directory
- Never use `any`. Use `unknown` + type guard if shape is uncertain
- All Zustand store slices must have explicit interface types

### Forms
- Use `react-hook-form` + `zod` for all forms
- Error messages must render below each field
- Disable submit button while loading, show spinner

### Components
- Shared UI: `components/shared/` (Navbar, Footer, AuthGuard, LoadingSpinner)
- Domain UI: `components/product/`, `components/cart/`, `components/checkout/`, etc.
- Never put business logic in page files — extract to hooks (`hooks/use-*.ts`)

### State
- Server data → React Query (or SWR). NOT Zustand.
- Client-only UI state → Zustand
- Form state → react-hook-form

### UI Component Library
- **`saas/` & `admin/`:** ShadcnUI (`@/components/ui/`)
- **`web/` & `mobile/`:** HeroUI (`@heroui/react`)
- Keep custom CSS minimal — prefer library props + Tailwind utility classes

### Naming Conventions
```
Pages:          app/[route]/page.tsx
Layouts:        app/[route]/layout.tsx
Components:     PascalCase.tsx
Hooks:          use-kebab-case.ts
Stores:         kebab-case.store.ts
Types:          types/domain.types.ts
API wrappers:   lib/api.ts (shared), lib/[domain]-api.ts (domain-specific)
```

