## COMMON MISTAKES TO AVOID

- ❌ Don't hardcode prices or product data — always fetch from API
- ❌ Don't store JWT in localStorage on web — use httpOnly cookie or in-memory
- ❌ Don't call `/api/saas/` from `web/` or `admin/` apps — those are saas-only
- ❌ Don't skip the `X-Tenant-ID` header — every shop API call needs it
- ❌ Don't render admin routes in `web/` — they are separate Next.js apps
- ❌ Don't use `useEffect` for data fetching — use React Query
- ❌ Don't create new Zustand stores for server data — that's React Query's job
- ❌ Don't forget to fire analytics events on key user actions
- ❌ Don't trust client-calculated prices — always verify on backend before checkout
- ❌ Don't render product pages as CSR-only — use SSR for SEO + stock freshness
